        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana UFB6000, 3 Inch Round Universal Floor Bumper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3 Inch Universal Door Stop is a floor mounted door bumper that is easy to install. All you have to do is drill one hole. The 3 Inch Round Universal Floor Bumper is available in a huge selection of finish colors. It is made from high-quality solid brass. Deltanta's UFB6000 Door Stop is 3 inches tall with a 1-1/8 inch Diameter. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-UFB6000-specifications.gif?v=1704354585\" width\"349\" height=\"308\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Solid Brass 3 Inch Universal Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-2-inch-universal-door-stop-deltana-ufb5000\">2 Inch High Universal Door Stop</a></b> and <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-1-1-2-inch-universal-door-stop-deltana-ufb4505\">1-1/2\" Inch High Universal Door Stop</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana UFB6000 3 Inch Universal Flood Bumper:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 3\" </li>\r\n<li>Height of Rubber from Floor: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Color: Black</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hardware: #12 x 1-1/2\" screw plus plastic anchor</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-UFB6000-Speifications.pdf?v=1704262416\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana UFB6000 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "3 Inch Universal Door Stop",
                "description": "The 3 Inch Universal Door Stop is a floor mounted door bumper that is easy to install. All you have to do is drill one hole. The 3 Inch Round Universal Floor Bumper is available in a huge selection of finish colors. It is made from high-quality solid brass. Deltanta's UFB6000 Door Stop is 3 inches tall with a 1-1/8 inch Diameter.",
